{
    "title": "Cast to TV - Mirroring",
    "description": "FREE APP FOR MIRRORING AND SCREEN CASTING TO TV\r\nAre you looking to easily mirror your phone screen to TV?\r\nWant the screen projection to be fast, stable, and responsive?\r\n\r\nUse CAST To TV - Mirroring , which is a screen mirroring free app that enables seamless mirroring of your smartphone onto the TV screen with superior quality. Enjoy streaming videos, music, photos, and more directly onto your large TV screen.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 The screen mirroring application facilitates swift and stable casting of your phone and tablet onto your TV. Our team designed a user-friendly interface and straightforward setup process, allowing users of all technical levels to easily cast phone screens or cast streams to TV.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc5KEY FEATURES\r\n\u2726 Cast smartphone screen to big TV screen stably\r\n\u2726 Simple & fast connection with just a click\r\n\u2726 Cast the mobile game to your big-screen TV\r\n\u2726 Cast to TV, Live video on Twitch, YouTube and BIGO LIVE\r\n\u2726 All media files supported, including photos, audios, E-books, PDFs, etc.\r\n\u2726 Show demonstrations in a meeting, watch travel slideshowswith family\r\n\u2726 Neat & clean user interface to create a good experience\r\n\u2726 Screen share in real-time speed.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcfaMultiple Devices Supported\r\n- Most smart TVs, LG, Samsung, Sony, TCL, Xiaomi, Hisense, etc.\r\n- Google Chromecast\r\n- Amazon Fire Stick & Fire TV\r\n- Roku Stick & Roku TV\r\n- AnyCast\r\n- Other DLNA Receivers\r\n- Other wireless adapters\r\n- supports most Smart TVs, DLNA Receivers, and wireless DISPLAY adapters\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0dHow to Use Screen Mirroring:\r\n1. Make sure your phone/tablet and smart TV are connected to the same Wi-Fi network.\r\n2. Enable \u201cWireless display\u201d on your phone.\r\n3. Enable \u201cM R cast\u201d on your smart TV.\r\n4. Search and pair the device.\r\n\r\n\r\nNote:\r\n- Your TV should support a Wireless Display or any sort of Display Dongles and sticks.\r\n- Before connecting the device, make sure your VPN is turned off (if any).\r\n- The TV must be connected to a WI-FI network same as your phone for our app for mirroring screens to work. \r\n- You can use our cast to tv tools such as the web browser, remote controller, image search, and more for a better experience.\r\nPricavy Policy: http://avfreeteam.blogspot.com/2017/08/antivirus-free-privacy-policy.html",
