t of Display Dongles and sticks.<br>- Before connecting the device, make sure your VPN is turned off (if any).<br>- The TV must be connected to a WI-FI network same as your phone for our app for mirroring screens to work. <br>- You can use our cast to tv tools such as the web browser, remote controller, image search, and more for a better experience.<br>Pricavy Policy: http://avfreeteam.blogspot.com/2017/08/antivirus-free-privacy-policy.html",
